DELETE /2.0/metadata_taxonomies/{namespace}/{taxonomy_key}
Delete a metadata taxonomy. This deletion is permanent and cannot be reverted.
Required: namespace (path) — The namespace of the metadata taxonomy.; taxonomy_key (path) — The key of the metadata taxonomy.

DELETE /2.0/metadata_taxonomies/{namespace}/{taxonomy_key}/nodes/{node_id}
Delete a metadata taxonomy node. This deletion is permanent and cannot be reverted. Only metadata taxonomy nodes without any children can be deleted.
Required: namespace (path) — The namespace of the metadata taxonomy.; taxonomy_key (path) — The key of the metadata taxonomy.; node_id (path) — The identifier of the metadata taxonomy node.

GET /2.0/metadata_taxonomies/{namespace}/{taxonomy_key}
Used to retrieve a metadata taxonomy by taxonomy key.
Required: namespace (path) — The namespace of the metadata taxonomy.; taxonomy_key (path) — The key of the metadata taxonomy.

GET /2.0/metadata_taxonomies/{namespace}/{taxonomy_key}/nodes/{node_id}
Retrieves a metadata taxonomy node by its identifier.
Required: namespace (path) — The namespace of the metadata taxonomy.; taxonomy_key (path) — The key of the metadata taxonomy.; node_id (path) — The identifier of the metadata taxonomy node.
